---
import JourneyNext from '../components/JourneyNext.astro';
import CanvasWorkbook from '../components/CanvasWorkbook.astro';
import NeighborhoodVignette from '../components/NeighborhoodVignette.astro';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import data from '../data/missional-canvases.json';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
const short = ['Audience','Connection','Identity','Relationships','Activities','Channels','Resources','Budget','Assessment'];
---
<BaseLayout lang="en" title="Missional canvas family" description="What really is the good news in our context? A shared canvas for churches, Christian nonprofits and businesses." credits={['Neighborhood film: Generated illustration · fictional neighborhood · 16 seconds · silent.']}>
<section class="family-head container">
 <p class="eyebrow">Context · calling · practice</p>
 <h1>What really is the good news<br/>in our context?</h1>
 <p class="lead">A missional identity canvas for work that keeps listening, discerning and adapting as the world around it changes.</p>
 <p class="version-note">Start with the church canvas. Christian nonprofit and business versions are draft adaptations for review.</p>
 <p><a href={`${base}/resources/missional-canvas-family-a3.pdf`}>Print all three canvases · A3 landscape PDF</a> · <a href={`${base}/resources/ministry-model-canvas-church-2024.pdf`}>Original church canvas · 2024</a></p>
<p class="canvas-start">Choose a version below. Explore its nine areas, then select <strong>Fill your canvas</strong> to write your answers and export them in the one-page canvas layout. Your draft stays in this browser; save a copy to keep it.</p>
</section>
<NeighborhoodVignette videoSrc={`${base}/assets/video/neighborhood-vignette-v7.mp4`} posterSrc={`${base}/assets/video/neighborhood-vignette-v7-poster.jpg`} />
<section class="family-body container">
 <nav class="family-nav" aria-label="Canvas versions">{data.variants.map(v=><a href={`#${v.id}`} data-variant={v.id}>{v.title}</a>)}</nav>
 <div class="canvas-mode" aria-label="How to use the canvas"><button type="button" data-canvas-mode="explore" aria-pressed="true">Explore the canvas</button><button type="button" data-canvas-mode="write" aria-pressed="false">Fill your canvas</button></div>
 <CanvasWorkbook />
 {data.variants.map(v=><section id={v.id} class="family-variant" aria-labelledby={`${v.id}-title`}>
  <header><h2 id={`${v.id}-title`}>{v.title}</h2><p class="version-note">{v.status}</p></header>
  <p class="overview-hint">The whole canvas · choose a block to explore its questions.</p>
  <div class="spatial-overview">{v.blocks.map((b,i)=><a class={`area-${b.number}`} href={`#${v.id}-block-${b.number}`} aria-label={`${b.number} ${b.title}`}><span>{b.number}</span><strong class="full-title">{b.title}</strong><strong class="short-title">{short[i]}</strong></a>)}</div>
  <div class="question-grid">{v.blocks.map(b=><article id={`${v.id}-block-${b.number}`} class:list={['question-block',{'identity-block':b.number==='03'}]} tabindex="-1"><p class="block-number">{b.number}</p><h3>{b.title}</h3><ul>{b.questions.map(q=><li>{q}</li>)}</ul></article>)}</div>
 </section>)}
 <section class="review-rhythm"><h2>Listen. Discern. Act. Revisit.</h2><p>Our context can change without us crossing a border. Invite the people affected by our work to correct our assumptions; read Scripture and pray together; make one concrete change; then review its faithfulness, effects and unintended costs. Set a review date—and return sooner when the context changes.</p><p>A commercial offer cannot stand in for the gospel. Neither impact metrics nor financial success can replace prayerful discernment and accountable relationships.</p></section>
 <p class="version-note">Adapted from Tobias Treppmann / Oratio&amp;Co, Ministry Model Canvas for churches (2024), in turn adapted from the Business Model Canvas. Draft nonprofit/business wording and review rhythm: Missional by Design, 2026. Shared under <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/">CC BY-SA 3.0</a>. <a href={`${base}/ministry-model-canvas/`}>Earlier canvas and workshop background</a>.</p>
</section>
<JourneyNext from="canvas" />
</BaseLayout>
<script>
import '../lib/canvas-workbook';
document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('.canvas-mode')!.style.display='flex';
const ids=['church','nonprofit','business'];
function selectCanvas(){
 const hash=location.hash.slice(1), requested=hash.split('-block-')[0], selected=ids.includes(requested)?requested:'church';
 document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('.family-variant').forEach(el=>el.hidden=document.querySelector('[data-canvas-mode="write"]')?.getAttribute('aria-pressed')==='true'||el.id!==selected);
 document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-variant]').forEach(el=>{if(el.dataset.variant===selected)el.setAttribute('aria-current','page');else el.removeAttribute('aria-current')});
 if(hash.includes('-block-'))requestAnimationFrame(()=>{const el=document.getElementById(hash);el?.scrollIntoView({block:'start'});el?.focus({preventScroll:true})});
}
addEventListener('hashchange',selectCanvas);selectCanvas();
</script>
<style>
.canvas-mode{display:none;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:24px 0}.canvas-mode button{font:inherit;font-size:14px;padding:12px 18px;border:1px solid var(--rule-strong);background:transparent;color:var(--ink);cursor:pointer}.canvas-mode button[aria-pressed=true]{background:var(--ink);color:var(--paper)}.canvas-mode button:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--focus);outline-offset:3px}.family-head{padding-top:72px;padding-bottom:44px}.family-head h1{font:400 clamp(44px,6vw,82px)/1.04 var(--mbd-editorial);letter-spacing:-.02em;max-width:23ch;margin:18px 0 28px}.family-head .lead{max-width:65ch}.eyebrow,.block-number,.overview-hint{font:500 var(--t-micro)/1.3 var(--sans);letter-spacing:.05em;color:var(--faint);font-stretch:105%}.version-note{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.6;max-width:90ch}.family-head p{margin-bottom:18px}.family-body{padding-bottom:70px}.family-nav{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;border-top:1px solid var(--rule);border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule);padding:22px 0}.family-nav a{border:1px solid var(--rule-strong);padding:10px 18px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink)}.family-nav a[aria-current=page]{background:var(--ink);color:var(--paper)}.family-variant{padding-top:35px}.family-variant[hidden]{display:none}.family-variant h2{font:400 46px/1.1 var(--mbd-editorial);margin-bottom:12px}.overview-hint{margin:25px 0 12px}.spatial-overview{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(10,minmax(0,1fr));grid-template-rows:110px 110px 90px;gap:1px;background:var(--rule-strong);border:1px solid var(--rule-strong)}.spatial-overview a{background:var(--paper-hi);color:var(--ink);padding:14px;text-decoration:none;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;min-width:0}.spatial-overview a:hover,.spatial-overview a:focus-visible{background:var(--tint);outline:2px solid var(--focus);outline-offset:-2px}.spatial-overview span{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.spatial-overview strong{font-size:15px;line-height:1.25}.short-title{display:none}.area-02{grid-area:1/1/3/3}.area-05{grid-area:1/3/2/5}.area-07{grid-area:2/3/3/5}.area-03{grid-area:1/5/3/7;background:var(--tint)!important}.area-04{grid-area:1/7/2/9}.area-06{grid-area:2/7/3/9}.area-01{grid-area:1/9/3/11}.area-08{grid-area:3/1/4/6}.area-09{grid-area:3/6/4/11}.question-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:1px;background:var(--rule-strong);border:1px solid var(--rule-strong);margin-top:30px}.question-block{background:var(--paper-hi);padding:26px;scroll-margin-top:100px}.question-block h3{font-size:21px;margin:10px 0 18px}.question-block ul{padding-left:20px}.question-block li{margin:12px 0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6}.identity-block{background:var(--tint)}.question-block:target{outline:3px solid var(--focus);outline-offset:-3px}.review-rhythm{border-top:1px solid var(--rule);margin:40px 0;padding-top:30px}.review-rhythm h2{font:400 42px/1.1 var(--mbd-editorial);margin-bottom:20px}.review-rhythm p{max-width:75ch;margin-bottom:20px}@media(max-width:760px){.family-head{padding-top:40px}.question-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.spatial-overview{grid-template-rows:88px 88px 68px}.spatial-overview a{padding:8px 4px;gap:7px}.spatial-overview .full-title{display:none}.spatial-overview .short-title{display:block;font-size:11px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.spatial-overview span{font-size:10px}.question-block{scroll-margin-top:25px}.family-head h1{font-size:46px}}@media print{.family-variant[hidden]{display:block}.family-nav,.spatial-overview,.overview-hint{display:none}.family-variant{break-before:page}.question-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}}
</style>
